OL,3,APassengers tell Israeli media pilot was
OL,4,Astabbed on flight diverted to Saudi
OL,5,AArabia
OL,6,
OL,7,FPassengers tell Israeli media a pilot
OL,8,Fon a Dubai-Tel Aviv flight was stabbed
OL,9,Fbefore the plane was diverted to land
OL,10,Fin Saudi Arabia
OL,12,FYasmin Abukasis says her daughter, who
OL,13,Fwas on board, heard screaming as a
OL,14,Fpilot called for help
OL,16,FAnother tells journalists that
OL,17,Fpassengers helped tackle one of the
OL,18,Fpilots and tie him down, writes our
OL,19,Freporter in Jerusalem
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
