OL,3,APassengers tell Israeli media pilot was
OL,4,Astabbed on flight diverted to Saudi
OL,5,AArabia
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Flydubai plane - which set off
OL,8,Fearly on Wednesday - signalled an
OL,9,Femergency code two hours into the
OL,10,Fflight, tracking website Flightradar24
OL,11,Fsays
OL,13,FIt then switched to a hijacking code
OL,14,Fbut later returned to a general
OL,15,Femergency signal - Israeli officials
OL,16,Ftell local media "a very serious
OL,17,Fdisaster was averted"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
