OL,3,APassengers tell Israeli media pilot was
OL,4,Astabbed on flight diverted to Saudi
OL,5,AArabia
OL,6,
OL,7,FData, examined by BBC Verify, shows how
OL,8,Fthe plane at one pointed plummeted by
OL,9,F17,000ft (5,200m) in less than two
OL,10,Fminutes - a passenger says it was "very
OL,11,Fstressful"
